OL,3,GNEWSAWomen urge menopause awareness to
OL,4,Aease loneliness
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who said she has menopausal
OL,7,Fsymptoms after being diagnosed with
OL,8,Fendometriosis at the age of 21 has
OL,9,Fdescribed her experience as lonely.
OL,11,FRachel Vivian, now 29, said she wanted
OL,12,Fto see more education for everyone,
OL,13,Fincluding businesses, as she shared her
OL,14,Fstory as part of Menopause Awareness
OL,15,FMonth.
OL,17,FSince being diagnosed with
OL,18,Fendometriosis in 2018 she has had five
OL,19,Fsurgeries and is taking medication
OL,20,Fcommonly used as a contraceptive to
OL,21,Fhelp, but she said the side effects
OL,22,Fmimicked menopausal symptoms.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
